## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design cross-process security in Android, focusing on IPC safety, Keystore usage, and crash recovery for UI-visible previews.

## Key Concepts
- Android IPC with AIDL across isolated processes
- Keystore-wrapped per-channel key rotation and revocation
- Secure payload validation with signature pinning
- Crash recovery and guarded state restoration

## Code Example
